{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-remote#card-zh","repo":"xgone/dsh-remote","commit":"dd551970c3ebda18fa48cdacbf7dc8c8056583f4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 是面向 DSH Web 的远程访问插件，为浏览器界面加入登录门禁，并提供 TOTP 两步验证、账号角色管理和远程文件查看。它在 DSH 的 webServer 路由与浏览器设置界面中工作，登录后可管理账号和允许的文件目录，也可在侧栏查看常见文档、代码、图片及媒体文件。适合需要从浏览器访问已运行 DSH Web 的用户。安装后需配置或创建 DSH 账号；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1236","lib/index.js:2602-2646","lib/client.js:1928","lib/files-store.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"xgone__dsh-remote#card-en","repo":"xgone/dsh-remote","commit":"dd551970c3ebda18fa48cdacbf7dc8c8056583f4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote adds login, TOTP sign-in, account roles, and remote file previews to DSH Web. It hooks into server routes and browser settings, where users can manage accounts and allowed directories. It is for people accessing an existing DSH Web instance from a browser and needs no external API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1236","lib/index.js:2602-2646","lib/client.js:1928","lib/files-store.js:20"]}
